    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάκλᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>forced position</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἄρθρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					6.1.15
				</span></i>
			 (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὄμματος</span>
			<i>drooping</i> of the eyelid, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.84
			</span></i> (vv. ll. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλισις, -κλεισις</span>),
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.675
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>refraction</i> of light or sound, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάκλασις</span> (reflexion), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				901b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				904b30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				2.6
			</span></i>.</div>
